v></div></div> <div class="topnav  svelte-1lbqjnn" style="z-index: 500; top: 0px; transform: translate(0px, 0px);  "><div class="topnav-container bg-stripes  svelte-1lbqjnn" style="opacity: 1; width:1368px;height:56px;min-width:1368px;min-height:56px;max-width:1368px;max-height:56px;"></div> <div class="layout-wrapper noselect svelte-166aivf" style="opacity: 1; width:1368px;height:26px;min-width:1368px;min-height:26px;max-width:1368px;max-height:26px;"><div class="w-full bg-[#3f350f]" style="height:24px;min-height:24px;max-height:24px;"><div class="w-full py-[2px] flex justify-between" style="border-width: 2px 0px; border-color: #846b08; "><div class="w-5 h-[16px] mr-1" style="background-image: url(&quot;data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewb='0 0 20 16'&gt;  &lt;rect width='20' height='16' fill='rgba(201,161,1,0)'/&gt;  &lt;path d='M23.92,23.92 L51.760000000000005,-3.92M16.080000000000002,23.92 L43.92,-3.92M8.240000000000002,23.92 L36.080000000000005,-3.92M0.40000000000000213,23.92 L28.240000000000006,-3.92M-7.439999999999998,23.92 L20.400000000000006,-3.92M-15.279999999999998,23.92 L12.560000000000006,-3.92M-23.119999999999997,23.92 L4.720000000000006,-3.92M-30.959999999999997,23.92 L-3.119999999999994,-3.92' stroke='rgba(201,161,1,1)' stroke-width='2.94'/&gt;  &lt;/svg&gt;&quot;); background-size: 20px 16px;"></div> <div style="height: 16px; --gap: 32vw; --play: true; --direction: normal; --duration: 1473s;" class="ticker-container bg-[#c9a101] text-[#3f350f] text-[14px] w-full font-bold uppercase svelte-vgyj8a"><div class="ticker svelte-vgyj8a" data-testid="ticker-slot" style="position: relative;"><span class="px-4 translate-y-[0.4px]">Don't forget to take breaks!...That is, if you want to be remembered as a coward.</span><span class="px-4 translate-y-[0.4px]">When unsure of what to do, don't think. Yell "Democracy!" and charge forward!</span><span class="px-4 translate-y-[0.4px]">Remember, October 26th is Liberty Day!</span><span class="px-4 translate-y-[0.4px]">When the mission timer runs out, the Super Destroyer will leave low orbit and you'll lose access to stratagems and reinforcements.</span><span class="px-4 translate-y-[0.4px]">The Super Destroyer can only stay in low orbit for a limited time - watch that mission clock!</span><span class="px-4 translate-y-[0.4px]">Arm injuries reduce your ability to handle recoil and will cause your aim to sway more.</span><span class="px-4 translate-y-[0.4px]">Choose your loadout carefully to ensure your squad has all the resources it needs. Democracy depends on it!</span><span class="px-4 translate-y-[0.4px]">Weapons like pistols and submachine guns can be used with one hand - perfect for when you need to carry objects in the other hands.</span><span class="px-4 translate-y-[0.4px]">Kill bugs before they get close. Remember, nothing protects your personal space better than bullets.</span><span class="px-4 translate-y-[0.4px]">As a last resort, you can use melee attacks to fend off enemies. Remember: death is better than cowardice!</span><span class="px-4 translate-y-[0.4px]">Caution: Angled fire may ricochet into squadmates.</span><span class="px-4 translate-y-[0.4px]">Dive responsibly.</span><span class="px-4 translate-y-[0.4px]">Remember: Freedom!</span><span class="px-4 translate-y-[0.4px]">The Ministry of Unity ensures that all of mankind is united as one by protecting us from internal threats, such as deviant behavior and expression of dangerous ideas.</span><span class="px-4 translate-y-[0.4px]">When enemy infrastructure is in need of destruction, Super Earth helpfully provides a Hellbomb stratagem to all Helldivers, free of charge.</span><span class="px-4 translate-y-[0.4px]">Use Stims to heal your injuries and replenish your stamina - or that of your fellow Helldivers, in a pinch!</span><span class="px-4 translate-y-[0.4px]">On a mission alone and dying to have someone liberating by your side? Use an SOS beacon to call in a fellow Helldiver.</span><span class="px-4 translate-y-[0.4px]">Pay attention to these tips. They've been carefully calibrated to ensure your success.</span><span class="px-4 translate-y-[0.4px]">Most weapons have different fire modes or functions - hold Reload to access them.</span><span class="px-4 translate-y-[0.4px]">The galaxy awaits your salvation! Become a Helldiver today!</span><span class="px-4 translate-y-[0.4px]">When your stamina is depleted, your sprint speed is slower and your accuracy is worse.</span><span class="px-4 translate-y-[0.4px]">Remember, October 26th is Liberty Day!</span><span class="px-4 translate-y-[0.4px]">If the enemies just keep coming, find out where they're coming from and unleash hell. Bug hive? Destroy! Bot factory? Destroy!</span><span class="px-4 translate-y-[0.4px]">The Ministry of Expansion tirelessly works to expand the reach of Freedom and secures vital resources for our society to thrive.</span><span class="px-4 translate-y-[0.4px]">Watch out for alien storms. Super Earth scientists have officially classified many of them as dangerous. And freaky.</span><span class="px-4 translate-y-[0.4px]">Managed Democracy is a cornerstone of advanced civilization.</span><span class="px-4 translate-y-[0.4px]">Most enemies have both weak spots and armored spots. The S.E.A.F. training manual recommends aiming for the weak spots.</span><span class="px-4 translate-y-[0.4px]">Pick up your dead squadmates dropped samples. There will be time for mourning later!</span><span class="px-4 translate-y-[0.4px]">The Ministry of Prosperity manages Super Earth's economy and ensures a steady flow of resources to the most deserving.</span><span class="px-4 translate-y-[0.4px]">Check your Ammo by holding the Reload button.</span><span class="px-4 translate-y-[0.4px]">Your stance has a significant impact on accuracy. The S.E.A.F manual lists the following stances in order of least to most accurate: Moving &lt; Standing &lt; Crouching &lt; Prone.</span><span class="px-4 tr