orking together can we ensure planets don't fall to the enemy.</span><span class="px-4 translate-y-[0.4px]">Don't forget to take breaks!...That is, if you want to be remembered as a coward.</span><span class="px-4 translate-y-[0.4px]">The Hellbomb is a tactical nuke powerful enough to destroy any perceivable target in its blast zone. For safety and budgetary reasons, it has to be armed manually once deployed.</span><span class="px-4 translate-y-[0.4px]">When unsure of what to do, don't think. Yell "Democracy!" and charge forward!</span><span class="px-4 translate-y-[0.4px]">The Ministry of Humanity maintains healthy, productive voters by managing education, healthcare, social grading, and gene management.</span><span class="px-4 translate-y-[0.4px]">On a mission alone and dying to have someone liberating by your side? Use an SOS beacon to call in a fellow Helldiver.</span><span class="px-4 translate-y-[0.4px]">Friendly fire, isn't.</span><span class="px-4 translate-y-[0.4px]">Caution: Angled fire may ricochet into squadmates.</span><span class="px-4 translate-y-[0.4px]">Your stance has a significant impact on accuracy. The S.E.A.F manual lists the following stances in order of least to most accurate: Moving &lt; Standing &lt; Crouching &lt; Prone.</span><span class="px-4 translate-y-[0.4px]">Don't worry - stims have zero addictive properties!* *Study paid for by Permacura. Permacura: put your life in our hands.</span><span class="px-4 translate-y-[0.4px]">When your stamina is depleted, your sprint speed is slower and your accuracy is worse.</span><span class="px-4 translate-y-[0.4px]">If the enemies just keep coming, find out where they're coming from and unleash hell. Bug hive? Destroy! Bot factory? Destroy!</span><span class="px-4 translate-y-[0.4px]">Diving to the ground can be a life-saver, but it also makes you an easy target for melee units.</span><span class="px-4 translate-y-[0.4px]">Don't run AWAY from chargers, run TOWARDS them!</span><span class="px-4 translate-y-[0.4px]">Most weapons have different fire modes or functions - hold Reload to access them.</span><span class="px-4 translate-y-[0.4px]">Remember, October 26th is Liberty Day!</span><span class="px-4 translate-y-[0.4px]">The galaxy awaits your salvation! Become a Helldiver today!</span><span class="px-4 translate-y-[0.4px]">Remember to fill in your C-01 permit before any act that could result in a child.</span><span class="px-4 translate-y-[0.4px]">The Ministry of Expansion tirelessly works to expand the reach of Freedom and secures vital resources for our society to thrive.</span><span class="px-4 translate-y-[0.4px]">Check your Ammo by holding the Reload button.</span><span class="px-4 translate-y-[0.4px]">Every citizen is equally important to the war effort, but Helldivers are the most important.</span><span class="px-4 translate-y-[0.4px]">Caution: Angled fire may ricochet into squadmates.</span><span class="px-4 translate-y-[0.4px]">Pick up your dead squadmates dropped samples. There will be time for mourning later!</span><span class="px-4 translate-y-[0.4px]">Managed Democracy is a cornerstone of advanced civilization.</span><span class="px-4 translate-y-[0.4px]">When enemy infrastructure is in need of destruction, Super Earth helpfully provides a Hellbomb stratagem to all Helldivers, free of charge.</span><span class="px-4 translate-y-[0.4px]">Remember to fill in your C-01 permit before any act that could result in a child.</span><span class="px-4 translate-y-[0.4px]">Difficult terrain inhibits your movement. Best practices recommend avoiding Snow, Mud, Water, Shrubberies, and Lava. For a complete list, see Manual Section D.198-2.</span><span class="px-4 translate-y-[0.4px]">Use Stims to heal your injuries and replenish your stamina - or that of your fellow Helldivers, in a pinch!</span><span class="px-4 translate-y-[0.4px]">The Ministry of Unity ensures that all of mankind is united as one by protecting us from internal threats, such as deviant behavior and expression of dangerous ideas.</span><span class="px-4 translate-y-[0.4px]">Watch out for alien storms. Super Earth scientists have officially classified many of them as dangerous. And freaky.</span><span class="px-4 translate-y-[0.4px]">Pay attention to these tips. They've been carefully calibrated to ensure your success.</span><span class="px-4 translate-y-[0.4px]">Remember: Freedom!</span><span class="px-4 translate-y-[0.4px]">Dive responsibly.</span><span class="px-4 translate-y-[0.4px]">If an enemy ever attempts to engaging in diplomacy, SHOOT THEM. We musn't believe their lies.</span><span class="px-4 translate-y-[0.4px]">The Ministry of Prosperity manages Super Earth's economy and ensures a steady flow of resources to the most deserving.</span></div><iframe style="display: block; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; overflow: hidden; border: 0; opacity: 0; pointer-events: none; z-index: -1;" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" src="about:blank"></iframe></div> <div class="w-5 h-[16px] ml-1" style="background-image: url(&quot;data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewb='0 0 20 16'&gt;  &lt;rect width='20' height='16' fill='rgba(201,161,1,0)'/&gt;  &lt;path d='M23.92,23.92 L51.760000000000005,-3.92M16.080000000000002,23.92 L43.92,-3.92M8.240000000000002,23.92 L36.080000000000005,-3.92M0.40000000000000213,23.92 L28.240000000000006,-3.92M-7.439999999999998,23.92 L20.400000000000006,-3.92M-15.279999999999998,23.92 L12.560000000000006,-3.92M-23.119999999999997,23.92 L4.720000000000006,-3.92M-30.959999999999997,23.92 L-3.119999999999994,-3.92' stroke='rgba(201,161,1,1)' stroke-width='2.94'/&gt;  &lt;/svg&gt;&quot;); background-size: 20px 16px;"></div></div></div></div></div> <div class="botnav svelte-1iwplae" style="z-index: 500; transform: translate(0px, 0px); bottom: 0px;  opacity: 1; undefined"><div class="bg-stripes  svelte-1iwplae" style="width:1368px;height:64px;min-width:1368px;min-height:64px;max-w